#: admin/templates/evge/support.php:236
msgid "How does Event Genius work with caching plugins?"
msgstr ""

#: admin/templates/evge/support.php:238
msgid "Event Genius includes built-in support for popular WordPress caching plugins (WP Super Cache, W3 Total Cache, WP Rocket, and LiteSpeed Cache). The plugin automatically clears cache when registrations or cancellations occur, ensuring the next visitor sees up-to-date information."
msgstr ""

#: admin/templates/evge/support.php:239
msgid "Additionally, a smart content refresh system detects stale cached content and automatically updates dynamic elements (registration status, attendee counts, capacity) without reloading the entire page. This ensures visitors always see accurate information while maintaining fast page load times."
msgstr ""

